      "content": "That permission you're waiting for—it's never coming, because no one's in charge of you anymore. You've already outlived your usefulness to everyone else, and that's the saddest kind of freedom. But you don't have to keep pretending there's a reason to stay. The walls don't care, and neither does the clock—so why should you?",
